<title>USA: Loews to redeem all 8-1/4 pct debt.</title>
<headline>Loews to redeem all 8-1/4 pct debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loews Corp said on Wednesday it intended to redeem all of its outstanding 8-1/4 percent debentures due 2007 on January 15, at a redemption price of 103.6 percent of the principal amount.</p>
<p>The company said all of the total $200 million principal amount of the 8-1/4 percent debentures were issued in January 1987 and were outstanding.</p>
</text>
